function fieldNotes(){return simple('Company field notes','Good conversations.<br><em>New possibilities.</em>','A look at the FORKLS community, through original company photography.')+section(`<div class="split"><div>${img('company-event','FORKLS at an industry exhibition','wide-photo portrait-photo')}<p class="caption">Company photography from forkls.com.</p></div><div>${eyebrow('The people behind the engineering')}<h2>It starts with<br><em>a conversation.</em></h2><p>A technical question at an exhibition can be the beginning of a development programme. Useful partnerships grow from understanding the problem and sharing the next step.</p><p>The original FORKLS gallery shows the company at industry exhibitions and gatherings. These moments connect the engineering work with the people putting it to use.</p>${actions(link('Start a conversation','/contact'))}</div></div><div class="photo-gallery">${img('company-conversation','A representative beside FORKLS’ exhibition display','photo')}${img('company-gathering','An industry gathering with FORKLS company signage','photo')}</div>`)+cta();}
function productionNews(){return simple('Product news · 7 September 2026','XRotor 2800.<br>A new chapter in <em>production.</em>','FORKLS has announced a high-volume production line for its XRotor 2800 brushless motor series.')+section(`<div class="article-body">${img('bldc-motor-cutaway','Illustrative brushless motor cutaway','article-art')}<p>In its published dispatch on 7 September 2026, FORKLS announced the inauguration of a full-scale production line for the XRotor 2800 motor series.</p><p>For a programme using XRotor 2800, the next step is to confirm the specific configuration, current availability, integration drawings and measured performance with the engineering team.</p><div class="article-actions">${link('Explore XRotor 2800','/motors/products/xrotor-2800')}<a class="textlink" href="https://forkls.com/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the original company announcement ↗</a></div><p class="caption">Motor illustration for this frontend. Source: FORKLS official news archive, 7 September 2026.</p></div>`)+cta();}
function engineeringNotes(){return simple('Engineering guide','Start with the mission.<br>Then choose the <em>motor.</em>','A useful starting point for a propulsion conversation.')+section(`<div class="article-body">${img('blueprint','FORKLS motor engineering drawing','article-art')}<p>A motor belongs to a complete system. The electrical supply, controller, propeller, mechanical interfaces and operating conditions all shape the selection.</p>${featureRows([['Define the operating point','Describe target thrust or torque, supply voltage, propeller, duty cycle, ambient conditions and available space.'],['Compare like with like','Request measured results for the same voltage, propeller, controller settings and test conditions. A single peak number is only one point in the envelope.'],['Plan the integration','Bring mounting details, drawings, thermal paths, control interfaces and procurement quantities into the conversation early.']])}<div class="article-actions">${link('Prepare an engineering brief','/contact?type=Custom%20engineering')}${link('Explore test & validation','/motors/testing','textlink')}</div></div>`)+cta();}
